# Space Mission Architect — Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values.
# This project does NOT require any API keys to run locally.
# All physics, 3D rendering, and simulation run entirely in the browser.

# --- Vite built-ins (used by the app, no manual configuration needed) ---
# VITE_MODE is set automatically by Vite (development | production)
# import.meta.env.PROD is used to register the Service Worker in production only.

# --- Future / optional integrations ---
# Uncomment and fill in if you add backend services:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-api.example.com
# VITE_ANALYTICS_ID=

